Alembic migration environment for the Sadhana Card Tracker.

The database URL comes from the same DATABASE_URL setting used by FastAPI.
For a new database:

    alembic upgrade head

To inspect SQL without a live PostgreSQL server:

    alembic upgrade head --sql

The initial revision enables pgcrypto and citext. Downgrade intentionally leaves
those database-wide extensions installed so it does not remove extensions that
may also be used by other schemas/applications.
